=== set up vm clipboard functionality ===

1. In proxmox command prompt
`qm set <VM_ID> -vga std,clipboard=vnc`

2. Install package on virtual machine
`sudo pacman -S spice-vdagent (arch linux)`

3. Input command into virtual machine
`sudo systemctl enable --now spice-vdagentd.service`

4. Perform test

Congratulations, you have added clipboard functionality to your proxmox hypervisor.
